0-09 21:12:55.000','999','2018-10-09 21:12:55.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2018-10-09 21:12:55.000','UserApplicant','2018-10-09 21:12:55.000'),(37,550051,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:07:09.000',1009,'MCNo10092018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 14:11:33.516','','2018-10-10 14:11:33.516','','Official website searched as regards Registered Projects, Pending project applications and list of notices pending u/s 59 but no result found in respect of Project Chinar Homes. Requisite reports may kindly be sought from AM(I) to verify. Submitted for kind consideration and further action please. ',1,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:07:09.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:07:09.000'),(38,550051,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:13:32.000',1010,'MCNo10102018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 14:17:56.875','','2018-10-10 14:17:56.875','','Similar complaint submitted by complainant vide complaint bearing No. MC No. 10092018 which is forwarded to this Hon\'ble Bench on 10.10.2018. May kindly be tagged with same for further necessary action, if any, please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:13:32.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:13:32.000'),(39,550051,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 14:19:57.000',1011,'MCNo10112018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 14:24:21.266','','2018-10-10 14:24:21.266','','Present complaint is against Directors of BCL Homes Ltd. of Project Chinar Homes. complainant earlier has filed two complaints against the said Project vide complaint bearing MC nos. 1009 & 1010 of 2018 dated 14.09.2018 which have been forwarded to this Hon\'ble Bench. Present complaint may also be attached to said  complaints for further necessary action, if any, submitted for kind consideration please. ',1,0,'le