(I) for confirmation. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.  ',1,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 15:21:49.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-10 15:21:49.000'),(42,550053,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 15:57:56.000',1014,'MCNo10142018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 16:02:20.547','','2018-10-10 16:02:20.547','','Complaint is attached as enclosure against Project Multitech Towers , GH-2, Sector 91, Mohali of Multitech Towers Pvt. Ltd. specifically against Block -D out of 7 towers (A to G)     Partial completion is issued in respect of other blocks except Block -D . Non-Registration of Project is pleaded. Official website not shown any results of Registration of the Project or notice u/s 59 of the Act against project \'Multitech Towers\'. Requisite report may kindly be sought from AM(I) in this regard. Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please. ',2,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 15:57:56.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-10 15:57:56.000'),(43,550051,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 16:07:03.000',1015,'MCNo10152018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 16:11:27.875','','2018-10-10 16:11:27.875','','Complaint against same respondents and Project forwarded to this Hon\'ble Bench vide complaint nos. MC no. 1009, MC no. 1010 and MC No. 1011 on 10.10.2018 itself. Present complaint may also be attached with said complaints . Submitted for kind consideration and further orders please. ',1,0,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 16:07:03.000','legaladvrera','2018-10-10 16:07:03.000'),(44,550053,'legaladvrera','2018-10-10 16:19:43.000',1016,'MCNo10162018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2018-10-10 16:24:07.500','','2018-10-10 16:24:07.500','','Complaint pertains to Project Siswan Paradise located near Siswan Dam. Official Website not showing 