6:17.000'),(167,550001,'999','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000',1074,'MCNo10742019','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000','999','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000','UserApplicant','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000'),(168,550001,'999','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000',1075,'MCNo10752019','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000','999','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000','UserApplicant','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000'),(169,550055,'pschairperson','2019-09-25 11:12:59.000',1065,'MCNo10652019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-09-24 22:49:44.573','','2019-09-24 22:49:44.573','','The complainant be informed that after the decision dated 24/07/2019 of Real Estate Appellate Tribunal in appeal No. 49 of 2018, this Authority can now entertain complaints in relation to project which are not registered with this Authority. Hence the complainant is free to file an appropriate complaint.',2,0,'pschairperson','2019-09-25 11:12:59.000','pschairperson','2019-09-25 11:12:59.000'),(171,550001,'999','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000',1076,'MCNo10762019','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000','999','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000','UserApplicant','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000'),(172,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:38:51.000',1065,'MCNo10652019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:15:50.767','','2019-10-09 22:15:50.767','','The complainant be informed that after the decision dated 24/07/2019 of Real Estate Appellate Tribunal in appeal No. 49 of 2018, this Authority can now entertain complaints in relation to project which are not registered with this Authority. Hence the complainant is free to file an appropriate complaint.',1,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:38:51.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:38:51.000'),(173,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:39:35.000',1062,'MCNo10622019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:16:34.774','','2019-10-09 22:16:34.774','','The complainant has mentioned about two enclosures to be attached with the complaint Annexures A & B respectively. However, Annexure B has not been received in full. The complainant be asked to submit the complete Annexures so that notice u/s 59 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 can be issued to the promoter.\r\n	The complainant may be asked to provide a copy of order dated 03/01/2019 of the National Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission.',1,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:39:35.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:39:35.000'),(174,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:04.000',1066,'MCNo10662019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:17:04.267','','2019-10-09 22:17:04.267','','The complaint has been considered. The matter regarding non-registration of the project \'Parsavanath Matrix\' was earlier taken up and notice u/s 59 was issued, in all likelihood. I recollect that a report from the PSIEC was also sought on Pasavanath\'s reply. Please link and put up.',1,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:04.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:04.000'),(175,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:48.000',1058,'MCNo10582019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:17:47.792','','2019-10-09 22:17:47.792','','Letter be sent to Improvement Trust, Sangrur seeking their response. \r\nThe complainant has mentioned that she had also filed an online complaint against non registration of this project. The status of that complaint may also be ascertained.',1,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:48.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:40:48.000'),(176,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:46:40.000',1019,'MCNo10192018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:23:39.560','','2019-10-09 22:23:39.560','','Complaint was merged with RKM Housing and further the case was filed on 26.09.2019 The complainants be informed accordingly',2,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:46:40.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:46:40.000'),(177,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:54:31.000',1027,'MCNo10272018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:31:31.072','','2019-10-09 22:31:31.072','','Not maintainable as the promoter has obtained the Completion Certificate on 28/03/2016. Informed the complainant accordingly',2,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:54:31.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:54:31.000'),(178,550055,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:58:01.000',1026,'MCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2019-10-09 22:35:01.022','','2019-10-09 22:35:01.022','','Not maintainable as the promoter has obtained the Completion Certificate on 28/03/2016. Informed complainant  accordingly. ',2,0,'pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:58:01.000','pschairperson','2019-10-10 10:58:01.000'),(179,550055,'pschairperson','201