falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of\r\nAuthority. Complainant alleged that the Project is not registered with the Authority  and further alleged various violations with regard to project. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law in case of \"Unregistered Project\". Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary\r\ndirections please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-06 07:32:21.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-06 07:32:21.000'),(189,550001,'999','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000',1079,'MCNo10792019','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000','999','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000','UserApplicant','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000'),(190,550053,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:21:51.000',1071,'MCNo10712019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-26 23:59:20.085','','2019-12-26 23:59:20.085','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of\r\nAuthority. Complainant alleged that the Project is not registered with the Authority and further\r\nalleged various violations with regard to project. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking\r\naction as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration\r\nand further necessary directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:21:51.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:21:51.000'),(191,550051,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:34:24.000',1073,'MCNo10732019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 00:11:53.308','','2019-12-27 00:11:53.308','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of\r\nAuthority. Complainant alleged that the Project is not registered with the Authority and further\r\nalleged that the builder failed to get the OC . In light of the above, an appropriate action u/s 59 of the Act may be taken in the matter. Accordingly, Complaint is forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions\r\nplease.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:34:24.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:34:24.000'),(192,550051,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:55:38.000',1075,'MCNo10752019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 00:33:06.117','','2019-12-27 00:33:06.117','','Present Misc. complaint is anonymous complaint and  falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that builder of Gulmohar city has only registered half of his project with RERA other half is still not registered with RERA. In this regard, it is submitted that the Promoter has registered his two projects with RERA Number PBRERA-SAS80- PR0336 (Gumohar City) and RERA Number PBRERA-SAS80- PR0337 (Gulmohar City Ext -1) at Kharar. The Complainant prayed to take action in the matter as per law. Accordingly, the present anonymous complaint is forwarded for kind consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:55:38.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 13:55:38.000'),(193,550051,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:17:53.000',1076,'MCNo10762019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 00:55:21.130','','2019-12-27 00:55:21.130','','Present Misc. Complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that he had purchased a plot in \'Friends Enclave\' at Village Gholu Majra, Derra Bassi and the Dealer sold him a wrong plot where high tension cable passing on. Further, he alleged that no water system is there and the dealer has neglected his request in the matter. The Complainant prayed to take action in the matter as per law.  In this regard, it is pertinent to mention here that a Project namely Friends Enclave is registered with RERA Number PBRERASAS80PR0340 at Village Kishanpura, Tehsil Zirakpur, District S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali. Moreover, the Authority may take initiate steps to get the information about the registration of the dealer. Accordingly, the present complaint forwarded for kind consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:17:53.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:17:53.000'),(194,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:32:36.000',1024,'MCNo10242018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:10:04.008','','2019-12-27 01:10:04.008','','Disposed.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:32:36.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:32:36.000'),(195,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:33:23.000',1014,'MCNo10142018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:10:51.561','','2019-12-27 01:10:51.561','','Disposed off.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:33:23.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:33:23.000'),(196,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:03.000',1025,'MCNo10252018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:11:30.940','','2019-12-27 01:11:30.940','','Disposed off.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:03.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:03.000'),(197,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:40.000',1026,'MCNo10262018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:12:08.106','','2019-12-27 01:12:08.106','','Disposed off.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:40.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:34:40.000'),(198,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:35:06.000',1027,'MCNo10272018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:12:34.180','','2019-12-27 01:12:34.180','','Disposed off.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:35:06.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:35:06.000'),(199,550054,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:42:15.000',1019,'MCNo10192018','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2019-12-27 01:19:42.880','','2019-12-27 01:19:42.880','','The Complaint was informed vide this office Memo No, 6274 dated 16.10.2019 that the matter has been filed due to non availability of evidence.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:42:15.000','legaladvrera','2019-12-27 14:42:15.000'),(200,550001,'999','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000',1080,'MCNo10802020','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000','999','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000','UserApplicant','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000'),(201,550051,'legaladvrera','2020-01-13 00:34:10.000',1077,'MCNo10772019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-12 11:11:17.867','','2020-01-12 11:11:17.867','','The Complainant alleged\r\n that the Project in question comes under ongoing Projects as on the date of\r\ncommencement of this Act as no Completion Certificate has been issued by the M.C.\r\nZirakpur and the respondent has not completed the works and provided the essential\r\nservices. Accordingly, the respondent may be directed to complete the works as mentioned\r\nin complaint and maintain all essential services till Completion Certificate is issued by the\r\ncompetent authority and take appropriate action against the Builders as the said Project is an\r\nUnregistered Project. This complaint has been filed by by an unregistered association and without a registered association, Authority cannot entertain the\r\ncomplaint of a group. In absence of registration of association, the residents or allottees of\r\nthe houses can file complaints in individual capacity.  An unregistered Complaint bearing GC Number 14542019 has also been filed by a complainant in individual capacity in Form M and the same has also been forwarded to this Bench of Authority. In view of the above, the present Complaint is submitted\r\nto this bench of Authority for consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2020-01-13 00:34:10.000','legaladvrera','2020-01-13 00:34:10.000'),(202,550053,'legaladvrera','2020-01-13 01:01:21.000',1079,'MCNo10792019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-01-12 11:38:29.471','','2020-01-12 11:38:29.471','','Present Misc. Complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. The present Complaint relates to the flat booked in Multi Tech Towers - 2. Complainant alleged that he filed a complaint w.r.t  said flat with this Authority in November, 2018 and Notice Under Section 59 of the Act was issued by the Authority to the builder. Builder replied to that notice that due to poor response, the project was shelved. The Builder informed that the project is no longer an ongoing project as such registration is not required and the process of refund has started. Now, the complainant alleged that more than 6 months have passed to the said reply, nothing has been received from builder in refund. It shows builder is intentionally defrauded and has no intention to refund the amount. In view of the above, the Complainant has requested for the Authority indulgence in the matter to get the amount back with interest. Accordingly, the present complaint is forwarded for kind consideration and further necessary directions please. Hard copy of the Complaint along with the previous file of the Complaint is being put up to this bench of Authority.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2020-01-13 01:01:21.000','legaladvrera','2020-01-13 01:01:21.000'),(203,550052,'legaladvrera','2020-02-09 20:56:53.000',1074,'MCNo10742019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member JSK','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-02-09 07:26:59.536','','2020-02-09 07:26:59.536','',' A communication vide  letter dated 28.08.2019 was received in this office vide Diary No. 4016 dated 02.09.2019 wherein Complainant alleged violations against M/s Satya Developers Pvt. Ltd. In response to this, this office vide its Memo No. 5185 dated 05.09.2019 requested him  to submit the complaint in proper form \'M\' or \'N\' as prescribed in Punjab Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017 through e -filing (online) at the official website of Authority. Further, the Complainant through communication received in this office on 17.10.2019 requested to do the needful. Complainant alleged that the respondents are denying to give possession of the Shop and monthly return. The project relates to Project \'CITY Centre Mall, Bathinda\' which is not registered as per the website of Authority. No requisite documents have been provided by the Complainant. The present complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this bench of Authority. Accordingly, the present complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2020-02-09 20:56:53.000','legaladvrera','2020-02-09 20:56:53.000'),(204,550055,'psmemberjsk','2020-02-10 10:11:09.000',1074,'MCNo10742019','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Return Back to Legal Advisor','97eba4f1-7be4-4ba2-848d-8ad65a317455','','2020-02-09 20:41:15.209','','2020-02-09 20:41:15.209','','notice to complainant be issued for 18.03.2020 to appear before this bench at 930AM and LA branch to put up a  hard copy of the misc complaint on that date',2,0,'psmemberjsk','2020-02-10 10:11:09.000','psmemberjsk','2020-02-10 10:11:09.000'