galrera','2020-07-24 14:53:37.000'),(223,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:01:14.000',1082,'MCNo10822020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-24 15:01:15.860','','2020-07-24 15:01:15.860','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the Project Ireo Waterfront Pvt Ltd have collected booking amounts and further instalments for allotment of shops in the said project and have promised assured incentive under Assured Incentive Payment Plan for Waterfront city central shops. Accordingly,  Complaint is forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:01:14.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:01:14.000'),(224,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:07:10.000',1083,'MCNo10832020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-24 15:07:11.564','','2020-07-24 15:07:11.564','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that M/s GBP is taking booking amount for their project \"Aerosi\" since 2018 . They are grabbing the money of innocent customers on the pretext of this dummy project to use the same for their own purpose .Further it is alleged that M/s GBP is running a fraud/scam whereby grabbing the money from people for such dummy projects and using the same for their purpose. Management of M/s GBP is involved in this well organized scam. They are not providing the documents related to their application for approval of said project under RERA and its present status. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.\r\n\r\n',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:07:10.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:07:10.000'),(225,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:14:42.000',1084,'MCNo10842020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-24 15:14:43.673','','2020-07-24 15:14:43.673','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged  that improvement trust Pathankot has auctioned shops on dtd 7-11-2016 ,almost more than 10 shops were auctioned and amount was deposited  but improvement trust pathankot has stopped construction due to unknown reasons,till date no electricity arrangement has been made and toilet block is incomplete. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:14:42.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:14:42.000'),(226,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:31:43.000',1085,'MCNo10852020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-24 15:31:45.298','','2020-07-24 15:31:45.298','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of\r\nAuthority. Complainant has raised a general query  to know if Star City, Gharuan is an approved project by PUDA or not. Further no document has been uploaded with this complaint.Accordingly, Complaint is forwarded for consideration and\r\nfurther necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:31:43.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:31:43.000'),(227,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:41:58.000',1086,'MCNo10862020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-24 15:42:00.157','','2020-07-24 15:42:00.157','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project Gobind Enclave is an Unregistered colony/ Project and further Alleged that Promoter is violating the statue and its rules by illegally carving out colony name (Gobind Enclave Near R.S.D College FZR City)without obtaining change of land use, and without any legal permission by the authorities.\r\n\r\n2. It is further Alleged that without obtaining any change of land use and without seeking permission from PUDA carved out unapproved colony and had started alienating different plots to their vendees. Approximately 50 kanal 10 marla has been sold to M/s J.s.R.Enterprises and have also sold other land to Several vendees.Till date they have sold away approximately 68 kanals of land in different parcels in the form of plots\r\n Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:41:58.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-24 15:41:58.000'),(228,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:41:00.000',1087,'MCNo10872020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 09:41:03.651','','2020-07-27 09:41:03.651','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project  Royal Enclave is an Unregistered Project Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:41:00.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:41:00.000'),(229,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:49:46.000',1088,'MCNo10882020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 09:49:49.652','','2020-07-27 09:49:49.652','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project is a registered project bearing RERA No. PBRERA-AS79-PR0101 ,further he alleged that Promoter is not providing completion/occupancy certificate  and demanding maintenance fee illegally. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:49:46.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:49:46.000'),(230,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:59:15.000',1089,'MCNo10892020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 09:59:18.542','','2020-07-27 09:59:18.542','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project \" City Heights Society\" is a Un-registered project  ,further he alleged that Promoter has not obtained completion/occupancy certificate till date. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:59:15.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 09:59:15.000'),(231,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:02:30.000',1090,'MCNo10902020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 10:02:33.526','','2020-07-27 10:02:33.526','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project \" City Heights Society\" is a Un-registered project ,further he alleged that Promoter has not obtained completion/occupancy certificate till date. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:02:30.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:02:30.000'),(232,550051,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:04:36.000',1091,'MCNo10912020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 10:04:39.901','','2020-07-27 10:04:39.901','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project \" City Heights Society\" is a Un-registered project ,further he alleged that Promoter has not obtained completion/occupancy certificate till date. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:04:36.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:04:36.000'),(233,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:15:01.000',1092,'MCNo10922020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 10:15:05.276','','2020-07-27 10:15:05.276','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project \" KSB Royal heights society behind KSB marigold homes chhaju majra colony at kharar, 126 sector,Mohali is a Un-registered project ,further he alleged that builder has failed to deliver the basic amenities like installation of lifts with backup facility, proper internal roads, marked parking area, boundary walls and security. Security of all the residents are at high risk as there is no facility of security guards. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:15:01.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:15:01.000'),(234,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:32:30.000',1093,'MCNo10932020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 10:32:33.714','','2020-07-27 10:32:33.714','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the project was started around 2010 and till date it was not completed so far. Builder has not obtained completion certificate from concerned department so far. Earlier \r\n similar complaint was filed bearing number  MCNo10802020 &  MCNo10712020. which is still under process.\r\nAccordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:32:30.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:32:30.000'),(235,550053,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:36:53.000',1080,'MCNo10802020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2020-07-27 10:36:56.839','','2020-07-27 10:36:56.839','','Present Misc. complaint falls under the jurisdiction of this Bench of Authority. Complainant alleged that the Project is not registered with the Authority and further alleged various violations with regard to project. Earlier application MCNo10712019 is forwarded to this bench. This complaint is in continuity with the previous complaint, whereas complainant is seeking an update of the previous complaint that whether it was considered or not. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:36:53.000','amlegalrera','2020-07-27 10:36:53.000'),(236,550001,'999','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000',1094,'MCNo10942020','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000','999','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000','UserApplicant','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000'),(237,550001,'999','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000',1095,'MCNo10952020','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000','999','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000','UserApplicant','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000')