er Even after 10 year establishment of Project they did not provide basic facility like Canal water, Sewerage, Lighting and Park till date . Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2020-11-05 17:02:50.000','amlegalrera','2020-11-05 17:02:50.000'),(246,550001,'999','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000',1101,'MCNo11012020','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000','999','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000','UserApplicant','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000'),(247,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:02:42.000',1095,'MCNo10952020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 12:02:43.358','','2021-01-07 12:02:43.358','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC10952020 of the Authority. Complainant alleged that the promoter had violated the statutory provision as provided under section 3 of the Act and because of non-registration under the Act, the consumers could not avail their rights as provided under the Act. Hence the consumers  alleged being attended with negligent services by the trust, misbehaved by their officials and prevented from basic amenities upon which they have several constitutional and statutory rights.  That the said project i.e\" Improvement Trust Barnala\" is still in- complete, and the concerned authority may also inquire the same. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:02:42.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:02:42.000'),(248,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:10:29.000',1096,'MCNo10962020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 12:10:30.358','','2021-01-07 12:10:30.358','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC10962020 of the Authority. Complainant alleged that he has booked a Duplex for an amount of 25 Lac with the Nature Heights Infra Ltd. and paid an amount of Rs 17,25,000/-. and the possession of the Duplex is given without finishing the work of Cupboard, Kitchen, Paint & POP, Door, Washroom etc. and further complainant has alleged that the promoter has promised to transfer the ownership of the Duplex on the name of the complainant as and when he paid the total amount. The complainant has given various reminder to the above said project but till date the the promoter has not get the registered deed or ownership on the name of the complainant.  Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:10:29.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:10:29.000'),(249,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:58:12.000',1098,'MCNo10982020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 12:58:13.421','','2021-01-07 12:58:13.421','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC10982020 of the Authority. Complainant alleged that the project \"SBP NORTH VALLEY\" is an ongoing project and has not taken the completion certificate till date, and hence complainant seeks direction  to complete the entire project as approved by the Authorities.Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:58:12.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 12:58:12.000'),(250,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 13:02:23.000',1099,'MCNo10992020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 13:02:23.843','','2021-01-07 13:02:23.843','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC10992020 of the Authority. Complainant alleged that the Services committed at the time of purchase of plots by builder (Gupta Builders and Promoters pvt. ltd.) like swimming pool, parks, club house, safe boundary wall , sufficient water supply, Sewage , rainwater drainage , street lights etc has not been completed yet after 4 years of possession of plots.. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 13:02:23.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 13:02:23.000'),(251,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:27:55.000',1100,'MCNo11002020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 14:27:56.014','','2021-01-07 14:27:56.014','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC11002020 of the Authority against the Un authorized colonies  in Ward 16 and 17 of Dera Bassi, Distt. S.A.S. Nagar, Punjab. Complainant alleged that these colonies do not fulfil any criteria required for such a project as per the requirements set by RERA in terms of (including but not limited to) Roads, Water Supply and Harvesting, Parks, Sewage Treatment Plant etc. Despite all these glaring omission, many plots have been developed and many are under development as the layouts / maps such development are being blindly approved by M.C officials due to their collaboration with these developers for their mutual benefit.Further complainant has alleged that these colonies have been given illegal Water and Sewage connections from Municipal Council Dera Bassi Lines. Moreover, Instead of registering the project as a whole with the concerned authorities by completing all the permissions, formalities, paperwork with RERA and paying the applicable tax and fees, the land mafia of these developers of unapproved / unauthorized colonies, which are developed on agricultural land, is selling the individual plots by registering the land from previous owner of the agricultural land, without any registry of the land in the name of developers. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:27:55.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:27:55.000'),(252,550008,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:33:16.000',1101,'MCNo11012020','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Authority','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-01-07 14:33:17.764','','2021-01-07 14:33:17.764','','Present Misc. complaint has been received vide Diary No.MC11012020 of the Authority against the project \"DD Chandigarh Enclave \'DD Enclave\'\". Complainant alleged that  the Promoter has  put hoardings near the colony to attract the investors and the genuine buyers without registering the Project with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority Punjab and Promoter has taken Regularization Certificate from the competent authority and has flouted all the applicable norms and procedures while obtaining it. That Promoter by not registering with the authority is selling the plots and might also lure other genuine buyers with their false assurances which would deprive them of the basic amenities. Accordingly, Complainant prayed for taking action as per law. Complaint forwarded for consideration and further necessary directions please.',1,0,'amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:33:16.000','amlegalrera','2021-01-07 14:33:16.000'),(253,550001,'999','2021-02-08 14:35:52.000',1501,'MCNo00012021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-02-08 14:35:52.000','999','2021-02-08 14:35:52.000','In Process','Form-Mis