5.000'),(267,550001,'999','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000',1510,'MCNo00102021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000','999','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000','UserApplicant','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000'),(268,550001,'999','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000',1511,'MCNo00112021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000','999','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000','UserApplicant','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000'),(269,550053,'legaladvrera','2021-07-02 10:48:53.000',1508,'MCNo00082021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2021-07-02 10:48:53.815','','2021-07-02 10:48:53.815','','The present Misc. complaint has been filed and preferred against the promoter namely TDI INFRATECH LIMITED for a new plotted project GOLF LINK in Sector 118 Mohali. The Complainant pointed out that (i) TDI Infratech Ltd. booked certain plots for sale without getting the said project first registered with RERA Punjab in contravention of the provisions of Rule 3 of RERA Act 2016. (ii) TDI Infratech has uploaded an advertisement in its website for booking of plots in Golf Link project, Sector 118, Mohali in gross violation of the said provisions of RERA Act. A copy of this advertisement is attached herewith as a proof Annexure C 3. The complainant has furnished some documents in support of his complaint. The Complainant has requested that a detailed enquiry may kindly be conducted to find out the facts regarding unauthorized and illegal booking of plots in Golf Link Sector 118 Mohali without registration of project.  Further, the TDI Infratech may also be directed to cancel all the illegal booking of plots made so far without registration of the project and to make refund of the amounts so collected from the concerned persons besides imposing penalty equal to 10 percent of the total cost of the project as provided under section 59 of the RERA Act 2016. It is pertinent to mention here that the project GOLF LINK has already been registered on 10.06.2021. The Complaint is submitted for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2021-07-02 10:48:53.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-02 10:48:53.000'),(270,550001,'999','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000',1512,'MCNo00122021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000','999','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000','UserApplicant','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000'),(271,550001,'999','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000',1513,'MCNo00132021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000','999','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000','UserApplicant','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000'),(272,550001,'999','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000',1514,'MCNo00142021','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000','999','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000','UserApplicant