e Act  in Form M for refund of her money along with interest. In terms of Order Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 dated 01.04.2021, the complaint is submitted for kind perusal and further directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-02-08 10:31:52.000','legaladvrera','2022-02-08 10:31:52.000'),(290,550001,'999','2022-02-23 12:38:01.000',1553,'MCNo00032022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-02-23 12:38:01.000','999','2022-02-23 12:38:01.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-02-23 12:38:01.000','UserApplicant','2022-02-23 12:38:01.000'),(291,550001,'999','2022-03-08 18:16:00.000',1554,'MCNo00042022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-08 18:16:00.000','999','2022-03-08 18:16:00.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-08 18:16:00.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-08 18:16:00.000'),(292,550001,'999','2022-03-09 14:41:54.000',1555,'MCNo00052022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-09 14:41:54.000','999','2022-03-09 14:41:54.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-09 14:41:54.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-09 14:41:54.000'),(293,550001,'999','2022-03-14 13:53:13.000',1556,'MCNo00062022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-14 13:53:13.000','999','2022-03-14 13:53:13.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-14 13:53:13.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-14 13:53:13.000'),(294,550001,'999','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000',1557,'MCNo00072022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000','999','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000'),(295,550001,'999','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000',1558,'MCNo00082022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000','999','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',1,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000'),(296,550001,'999','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000',1559,'MCNo00092022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000','999','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000'),(297,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-17 10:53:01.000',1506,'MCNo00062021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-17 10:53:01.942','','2022-03-17 10:53:01.942','','Present complaint received against Project namely \'Dara Kingdom\' situated at Village Khooni Majra, Sector 115, Kharar. The Complainant submitted that he had paid an amount of Rs. 57,500/- to Dara Group for One BHK for the mentioned project but still not any update from Dara Group. The Complainant has attached a copy of Agreement dated 21.08.2018 and booking certificate dated 16.10.2017. As per the records/information available on our website, the said project is not registered with this Authority. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the Complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-17 10:53:01.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-17 10:53:01.000'),(299,550001,'999','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000',1560,'MCNo00102022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000','999','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000'),(300,550001,'999','2022-03-20 14:09:55.000',1561,'MCNo00112022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-03-20 14:09:55.000','999','2022-03-20 14:09:55.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-03-20 14:09:55.000','UserApplicant','2022-03-20 14:09:55.000'),(301,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 18:48:04.000',1507,'MCNo00072021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 18:48:06.621','','2022-03-20 18:48:06.621','','Present complaint received against the Project namely \'Prince Homes\' situated at Sector 123, Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali. The Complainant submitted that he had booked a unit in \'Prince Homes\' and initially he paid Rupees Fifty Thousand as a token money. Later, he came to know that the project is not registered with RERA. The Complainant has asked the builder to refund the money as the project is not approved by RERA. The Complainant has prayed for refund of money deposited by him. The Complainant has attached a copy of receipt of booking amount and extract of Brochure. As per the records/information available on website of Authority, the said project is not registered with this Authority. In view of the above, we may write to the complainant to institute a complaint under Form M for the refund of money deposited by him and a notice under Section 59 of the Act may be issued to the promoter for not registering the project with the Authority. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 18:48:04.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 18:48:04.000'),(302,550053,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:46:06.000',1509,'MCNo00092021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 19:46:08.887','','2022-03-20 19:46:08.887','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Homeland Heights\' located at Sector 70, Mohali.  The promoter of the said project is \'Homeland Buildwell Pvt. Ltd.\' The Complainant has submitted that the project has no completion certificate as of date and no environment clearance for changes made to the project after RERA came into effect. The Complainant has further submitted that the project needs to be registered under Section 3 of the RERA Act. The Complainant has prayed to take suo moto notice and register the project. The Complainant has attached a copy of (i) GMADA approvals for extension of project for flats and shops and (ii) RWA mails to builder for non completion of project. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:46:06.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:46:06.000'),(303,550051,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:58:50.000',1510,'MCNo00102021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 19:58:52.777','','2022-03-20 19:58:52.777','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of unregistered projects complaints. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Palm Garden\' located at National Highway 1, Sahnewal, adjoining Red Mango, Ludhiana. The Complainant submitted that the project is not registered and attached  copies of advertisement downloaded from the internet. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:58:50.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 19:58:50.000'),(304,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:25:55.000',1511,'MCNo00112021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 20:25:57.690','','2022-03-20 20:25:57.690','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project (no name mentioned) located in Village Kot Kalan Google Coordinates- 31.2752779,75.6651985 and another erecting on Jamsher dhina road behind Indian oil petrol Pump Google Location-31.2546967,75.6124384, Tehsil Jalandhar. The Complainant submitted that the developer has violated the provisions of PAPR Act 1995 and has divided the land into plots and are setting up a colony over an area of land which is more than one thousand sq meter without obtaining a license from the competent authority also fraud has been done to the general public by selling them plots in the illegal colony and the promoter of the colony has also violated Central Govt guidelines by violating section 3 of RERA Act. The complainant has requested to direct the concerned to demolish the above-said colony and also place a notice board to aware the general public not to buy any plot in such illicit colony. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:25:55.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:25:55.000'),(305,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:49:22.000',1512,'MCNo00122021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 20:49:24.715','','2022-03-20 20:49:24.715','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of unregistered projects complaints. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'SBP Homes 3\' situated at Sector 126, Tehsil Kharar, District Mohali, Punjab. The Complainant submitted that (i) construction of the road is not shown in the map which is issued by Competent Authority (ii) there is illegal Construction of RWA Office in the Common Area (iii) only Partial Completion Certificate has been taken by the Competent Authority on 19.12.2016, that is after the commencement of the RERA Act 2016 i.e. 01.05.2016 (iv) the promoters had contravened the provisions of the RERA Act 2016. The Complainant has prayed to issue order / notice / direction to the promoter to register the project as per the RERA Act 2016, call for the records from the promoter and levy fine as per section 59 of Act, if the violations are met in the investigation. The Complainant has enclosed the copies of relevant documents and approved map. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:49:22.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 20:49:22.000'),(306,550051,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:19:23.000',1513,'MCNo00132021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 21:19:25.856','','2022-03-20 21:19:25.856','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of unregistered projects complaints. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Coral Floors\' located in Village Devatwal, Ludhiana, Punjab. The Complainant submitted that this project named coral floor doesn\'t appear in list of registered projects on Rera Punjab website. The Complainant through email had requested the promoter to provide the RERA Registration Number of the pocket in which Coral Floors exist but the promoter did not respond to his email. The Complainant has enclosed the copy of Request for registration Number of project. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:19:23.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:19:23.000'),(307,550053,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:35:57.000',1514,'MCNo00142021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 21:35:59.043','','2022-03-20 21:35:59.043','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of unregistered projects complaints. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Satkar Vihar\' situated at GT Road Main Delhi Amritsar Highway NH 1 Near Eagle Motel Rajpura. The Complainant submitted that the promoter has not developed this project and took money from the allottees in 2011 and the promoter had done Ikrarnama with them for the plots but no registry has been executed. The Complainant has requested the Authority to issue notice against the promoter. The Complainant has enclosed the copies of Ikraranama and photographs of the site. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:35:57.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 21:35:57.000'),(308,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:13:36.000',1515,'MCNo00152021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 22:13:38.840','','2022-03-20 22:13:38.840','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of unregistered projects complaints. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Shivalik Vihar located at Shivalik Vihar Homes, near Shivalik City, Chhajumajra, Kharar. The Complainant submitted that he is a resident of the Shivalik Vihar Homes since 2016 and it was committed by the Builder that road will be constructed in next few months. But it\'s been 4 years and the road was never built from House no. 38 to 48. Now the promoter has completely denied building the road.  The Complainant has requested the Authority to take action against the promoter. The Complainant has submitted that Builder\'s RERA registration application is still pending. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:13:36.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:13:36.000'),(309,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:22:38.000',1516,'MCNo00162021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 22:22:40.840','','2022-03-20 22:22:40.840','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'ZUMIRAH HOMES\' located at Behind Kapco Floors in JTPL city, Sector 115, Kharar opposite Railway Station Kharar. The Complainant submitted that Balwinder Singh Billu and Amrik Singh Kamboj have sold 19 plots and 63 flats/apartments without RERA registration because they have not obtained any project approval from MC, local government or PUDA.  The Complainant has attached the OLX advertisement and map of colony being sold without RERA registration. The Complainant has requested the Authority to take action against the promoter. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:22:38.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:22:38.000'),(310,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:40:11.000',1518,'MCNo00182021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 22:40:13.481','','2022-03-20 22:40:13.481','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'ECO Floor-II\' located at Jhungian Road, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar. The Complainant submitted that he purchase a flat from Bajwa Developers Ltd. But the promoter did not give the possession of unit. The Complainant has requested to give the possession of flat. As per the records/information available on website of Authority, the said project is not registered with this Authority. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:40:11.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:40:11.000'),(311,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:44:02.000',1519,'MCNo00192021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 22:44:04.543','','2022-03-20 22:44:04.543','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'ECO Floor-II\' located at Jhungian Road, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar. The Complainant submitted that Bajwa Developers launched the said project without RERA Number and they had sold all the flats and done the registry without RERA Number. As per the records/information available on website of Authority, the said project is not registered with this Authority. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:44:02.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 22:44:02.000'),(312,550051,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 23:05:23.000',1520,'MCNo00202021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-20 23:05:25.418','','2022-03-20 23:05:25.418','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely TECH TOWN located at Village Dayalpura, Zirakpur, Dera Bassi, Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar. The Complainant submitted that he had booked plot number 298 dated 07.12.2018 and paid Rs. 5,17,372 as booking amount. The developer did not provide the complainant Rera Number and nor refund his booking money till date. The Complainant has requested to take action against the promoter. As per information provided on our website, the project TECH TOWN has been registered with this Authority. The Complainant may be asked to institute his compliant under Section 31 of the Act in the prescribed format, if he has any grievance against the project. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-20 23:05:23.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-20 23:05:23.000'),(313,550051,'legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:07:10.000',1521,'MCNo00212021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member SG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-21 02:07:12.340','','2022-03-21 02:07:12.340','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'ATS Golf Meadows -Extn. 2\' situated at Derra Bassi, Village Madapur and Sadhemajra Tehsil Derrabassi District SAS Nagar. The Complainants submitted that they had purchased a plot measuring 145.83 sq mts. in the project and the plot was registered in their name in 2015. Hon\'ble High Court of Punjab and Haryana had passed an interim order dated 25.02.2019 in CWP No. 4894 of 2019 for maintaining status quo on the project in which their plot is located. Due to this, they are unable to construct a house from last two years. The Complainants further submitted that the builder did not respond to any email and even to legal notice and the competent authority did not approve the building plan stating that stay imposed by the High Court. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:07:10.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:07:10.000'),(314,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:31:20.000',1557,'MCNo00072022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-21 02:31:22.637','','2022-03-21 02:31:22.637','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'My Homes Society\' situated at Sec-127, Kharar, District SAS Nagar. The Complainant submitted that he had purchased a residential plot on 15-04-2008 in the project. Copy of sale deed of it is attached. As per complaint, the promoter while selling the plot had assured complainant that project is passed from competent authorities and he will do complete development of this residential project but till now the project is not developed and nor promoter paid complete Govt. Fee, promoter paid a partial fee to MC Kharar. The Complainant has prayed for registration of project under RERA Act. In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:31:20.000','legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:31:20.000'),(315,550049,'legaladvrera','2022-03-21 02:35:55.000',1553,'MCNo00032022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2022-03-21 02:35:57.981','','2022-03-21 02:35:57.981','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'My Homes Society\' situated at Sec-127, Kharar, District SAS Nagar. The Complainant submitted that he had purchased a residential plot on 15-04-2008 in the project. Copy of sale deed of it is attached. As per complaint, the promoter while selling the plot had assured complainant that