nt submitted that the project II PCL Greenways measuring 20 acres was not got registered by promoters from RERA Authority Punjab as mandatory under Section3 of the Act despite collecting 37 crores from 179 buyers in the year 2011 and this has been proved in the judgement dated 28.10.2021 passed by Adjudicating officer of Authority in complaint No. AdC 1352 of 2019 titled as Bithal Hari Sharma vs Innovative Housing and Infrastructure Pvt Ltd. The promoter vide letter dated 01.11.2019 in reply to this office notice had admitted that  they planned a project at Village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh and purchased approx. 20 acres land to establish a new project and then they applied to the Government on 28.12.2018 under PAPR Act, 1995 but they were unable to take that project further. The project situated at Village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh which is in Kharar tehsil of Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar district in Punjab.  In terms of Order conveyed vide this Office Endst. No. RERA/AMA(I)/Pb./2021/2328 on 01.04.2021, the complaint is forwarded to the Learned Bench of Member (APS) for kind consideration and further necessary action/directions please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2022-08-10 13:56:26.000','legaladvrera','2022-08-10 13:56:26.000'),(335,550001,'999','2022-08-12 01:20:38.000',1579,'MCNo00292022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-08-12 01:20:38.000','999','2022-08-12 01:20:38.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2022-08-12 01:20:38.000','UserApplicant','2022-08-12 01:20:38.000'),(336,550001,'999','2022-08-20 13:10:06.000',1580,'MCNo00302022','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2022-08-20 13:10:06.000',