New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000','999','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000','UserApplicant','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000'),(355,550001,'999','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000',1599,'MCNo00142023','Complaint Form-Misc (New Application)','Form-Misc submitted by Complainant with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)','Role Complainant','HelpDesk Level I','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000','999','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000','In Process','Form-Misc Submission (New Application)',2,0,'UserApplicant','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000','UserApplicant','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000'),(356,550048,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 13:48:37.000',1599,'MCNo00142023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member RKG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-03 13:48:37.828','','2023-10-03 13:48:37.828','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'ATS Golf Meadows GM 3\' located at Village Madhopur, Derabassi, Mohali, Punjab. The Complainant has submitted that M/s ATS Estates Private Limited has grabbed money for this RERA expired project Unit/Plot Bearing No. 5 Village Madhopur Tehsil Dera Bassi Mohali Punjab. The Complainant has attached a RERA List of projects and legal notice to M/s ATS Estates Private Limited. The Legal Notice enclosed reveals that the complainant intends to return the money with interest till the date of realization. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Derabassi, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Shri Rakesh Kumar Goyal, Ld. Member of the Authority for kind consideration please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 13:48:37.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-03 13:48:37.000'),(357,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:07:50.000',1597,'MCNo00122023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-03 15:07:50.688','','2023-10-03 15:07:50.688','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Dristhi Avenue\' located at Chajju Majra, Sector 126, Tehsil Kharar, Mohali. The Complainant has submitted that the project is unauthorized, no sewage, no water, nothing as promised. The Complainant has attached a copy of registry of flat. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Shri Ajay Pal Singh, Ld. Member of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:07:50.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:07:50.000'),(358,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:35:48.000',1598,'MCNo00132023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-03 15:35:48.859','','2023-10-03 15:35:48.859','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Sector 88-89 including Purab Premium Apartments\' located at Sector 88, Mohali. The Complainant has submitted that GMADA had launched scheme for sale of 550 flats in July 2023 inspite of the fact that Registration No. PBRERASAS81PM0121 had already lapsed wayback in 2018-19. He further submitted that he has also filed a complaint with the Authority vide Diary No. 5425 dated 28.08.23 but no action has been taken. Further, he submitted that 313 applications against allotment of 550 flats have been received and GMADA is in the process of making allotments. He has prayed to take immediate appropriate action in the matter. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Mohali, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:35:48.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-03 15:35:48.000'),(359,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:07:55.000',1595,'MCNo00102023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 13:07:58.927','','2023-10-09 13:07:58.927','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Aastha Enclave\' located at Dhanaula Road, Barnala. The Complainant has submitted that the project \'Aastha Enclave\' located at Barnala was developed in 2005-06 and was completed and handed over to the local Authority. Now after the coming into force of the RERA Act, 2016 the said developer Barnala Builders Ltd. through its director Deepak Bansal is making extension to the said colony without getting registering the project with RERA in utter violation of section 3 of RERA Act, 2016 is liable for action under section 59 of the RERA Act, 2016. The project falls under the jurisdiction of District Barnala, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:07:55.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:07:55.000'),(360,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:22:46.000',1594,'MCNo00092023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 13:22:50.114','','2023-10-09 13:22:50.114','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Serenity Sky\' of Premia Realtors Private Limited located at Sector-123, Sunny Enclave, SAS Nagar Mohali, Punjab. The Complainant has submitted that he has entered into an agreement with the promoter vide Agreement to Sell dated 24.05.2022, wherein it has been mentioned that M/s Premia Realtors Private Limited will hand over the Property Unit No 45, Floor No. 3rd, Area approx. (1165 sq. ft.) situated at Sector-123, Sunny Enclave, SAS Nagar Mohali, in lieu of agreed consideration amounts to Rs. 41,25,000 (Forty-One Lakh Twenty-Five Thousand Only). However, against the aforesaid mentioned consideration payment of Rs. 8,25,000/- (Eight Lakh Twenty-Five Thousand Only) has been made and the balance to be paid according to Construction Linked Payment Plan. As per the Point No. 14 of the Agreement, the said handover of the Property shall be made on or before 31st March 2023 which extended to 30th April 2023 later on. Moreover, no such handover is made till date nor the money is refunded. In addition to the above the company also required to get itself registered under RERA Act but no such information is provided to us by the company. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (APS) for kind consideration and further orders please.\r\n\r\n',2,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:22:46.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 13:22:46.000'),(361,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 14:04:31.000',1589,'MCNo00042023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 14:04:35.427','','2023-10-09 14:04:35.427','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Chirag Home 2\', Near Arista Palace, Sunny Enclave Sector 123, Mohali. The Complainant has submitted that on 09/02/2023, he went to PSPCL Mohali office for permanent meter connection from temporary meter connection but officials of PSPCL refused to accept his application because NOC from builder is pending and map of colony from builder is pending. The Complainant has submitted that he has obtained NOC from Municipal Corporation and also paid IDC, EDC and water connection charges to builder. The Complainant has requested to take an action in this regard. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (APS) for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 14:04:31.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 14:04:31.000'),(362,550048,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:14:51.000',1582,'MCNo00322022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member RKG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 15:14:55.068','','2023-10-09 15:14:55.068','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely City Court adjoining Chandigarh Panchkula on Zirakpur Shimla Highway, Zirakpur. The Complainant has submitted that the project has scammed him, for Rs. 30 000. The Complainant has pointed out that the fire escape and electricity are not as per the government guidelines. The project is not registered but fraudulent company Vaneet Infra sells this property and gives offices on rent to promote it and on property websites they list other RERA numbers, faking and scamming people. They mention the other RERA address for other properties. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Derabssi, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (RKG) for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:14:51.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:14:51.000'),(363,550048,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:30:50.000',1577,'MCNo00272022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member RKG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 15:30:54.365','','2023-10-09 15:30:54.365','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Coral Floors, Village Issewal, off Ferozepur Road, Ludhiana. The Complainant has submitted that he has searched all the registration in name of ireo waterfront and coral floors and he has nowhere found the name of Coral Floors as registered project or in any of the pockets shown registered on RERA Punjab site. The promoter has been reminded several times to provide me this information but has failed to do so. when contacted on phone, they were not sure of its registration. The Complainant has submitted that he is the allottee of a floor no 31B in this coral floors and has favourable adjudication order dt. 09.07.21 in respect of refund with interest and compensation As the builder is not parting with the information relating to its registration under RERA the builder appear to be running this coral floor without registration Agreement to sell was executed well before the enactment of RERA 2016 so it does not contain particulars of registration. The Complainant has requested that the matter may be looked into and suitable action may be taken. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Ludhiana, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (RKG) for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:30:50.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:30:50.000'),(364,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:42:42.000',1526,'MCNo00262021','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-09 15:42:46.130','','2023-10-09 15:42:46.130','','Since the grievance of complainant is of personal nature, accordingly, vide email dated 20.03.2023, the complainant was advised to file his complaint under Section 31 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in Form M or Form N.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:42:42.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:42:42.000'),(365,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-10-09 15:5