Authority, the matter was sent to the Registration Branch for seeking their comments with regard to registration of the said project so that necessary action could be taken in the matter. The Registration Branch of the Authority has submitted that the project Dreamcity, Ludhiana is neither registered nor in the process of registration with this Authority. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Ludhiana, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (RKG) for kind consideration and further orders please.\r\n',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-10 13:19:35.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-10 13:19:35.000'),(371,550048,'legaladvrera','2023-10-10 13:27:05.000',1581,'MCNo00312022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member RKG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-10 13:27:05.162','','2023-10-10 13:27:05.162','','The complaint has been received against the Project namely Dreamcity Ludhiana located at Village Devatwal, off Ferozepur road, Sidhwan Canal, Ludhiana. The Complainant has submitted that AIPL, Badshahpur, Sector 66, Gurgaon, Haryana 122101 is the developer of the project Dreamcity Ludhiana and selling plot/flats rendering themselves liable for action under section 59 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development), Act,2016 and other sections thereof for violation of section 3 and 4 of the said Act. The Complainant has further submitted that there are also violation of Section 34(b) and 84(2)(p) of Real Estate (Regulation and Development), Act,2016 and other sections thereof read with rule 15 and other rules of Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017. Before putting the matter to the concerned Bench of the Authority, the matter was sent to the Registration Branch for seeking their comments with regard to registration of the said project so that necessary action could be taken in the matter. The Registration Branch of the Authority has submitted that the project Dreamcity, Ludhiana is neither registered nor in the process of registration with this Authority. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Ludhiana, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member (RKG) for kind consideration and further orders please.\r\n',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-10 13:27:05.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-10 13:27:05.000'),(372,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 10:18:19.000',1579,'MCNo00292022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 10:18:22.777','','2023-10-23 10:18:22.777','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'Highway Plaza\' located at Landran Road, Opposite Micky Vibrant, Kharar, SAS Nagar, Punjab. The Complainant has submitted that the project \'Highway Plaza\' is not in the list of Registered projects. The Complainant has requested to do the needful for the registration of the project as per the norms.. The Complainant has attached a copy of registry of flat. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Shri Ajay Pal Singh, Ld. Member of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 10:18:19.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 10:18:19.000'),(373,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:02:08.000',1596,'MCNo00112023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 11:02:11.527','','2023-10-23 11:02:11.527','','Since the complainant has requested for information of the project, it has been advised him to seek the information, if available under RTI Act from the concerned authorities vide this office email dated 12.10.2023.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:02:08.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:02:08.000'),(374,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:27.000',1562,'MCNo00122022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 11:07:30.449','','2023-10-23 11:07:30.449','','The Complainant has submitted that promoter is executing false, forged, fabricated and manipulated sale deed in favor of the purchasers by grabing, encroaching the area i.e roads, Green Belts, Green Strips belonging to the general public and inhabitants of the area and raising illegal constructions of villas in contravention with the sanctioned lay out plan of Jalandhar Development Authority i.e drawing No.GE/101 dated 28.03.2016, licence No.2144 - 48 dated 21.08.2019, for making false inducement to the inhabitants/ purchasers of the Garden Villa to part with their hard earned money and executing the sale deeds of the roads, Green Strips, Green Belts etc. and also not provided amenities which he committed.\r\nIn terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, the complainant is required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. Accordingly, it has been advised the complainant to file a formal complaint under Section 31 of the Act in Form M or Form N.\r\n',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:27.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:27.000'),(375,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:59.000',1564,'MCNo00142022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 11:08:02.652','','2023-10-23 11:08:02.652','','The Complainant has submitted that promoter is executing false, forged, fabricated and manipulated sale deed in favor of the purchasers by grabing, encroaching the area i.e roads, Green Belts, Green Strips belonging to the general public and inhabitants of the area and raising illegal constructions of villas in contravention with the sanctioned lay out plan of Jalandhar Development Authority i.e drawing No.GE/101 dated 28.03.2016, licence No.2144 - 48 dated 21.08.2019, for making false inducement to the inhabitants/ purchasers of the Garden Villa to part with their hard earned money and executing the sale deeds of the roads, Green Strips, Green Belts etc. and also not provided amenities which he committed.\r\nIn terms of Regulation 4 (2) of The Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority (Procedure for Handling Complaints and Related Matters) Regulations 2017, the complainant is required to mention the specific provisions of the RERA Act and Rules alleged to have been violated. Accordingly, it has been advised the complainant to file a formal complaint under Section 31 of the Act in Form M or Form N.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:59.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:07:59.000'),(376,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:45:12.000',1567,'MCNo00172022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 11:45:15.762','','2023-10-23 11:45:15.762','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'PDA Omax City Patiala\' located at Sirhind road village Baran Patiala. The Complainant has submitted that the project was started in April 2010 and it is still ongoing and far away from completion as even basic amenities are not available at the site, so it must be registered with RERA Punjab u/s 3 of RERA Act, 2016. Allotment letter was issued to complainant on 30-Dec-2010 vide memo 3168 and the possession was to be delivered within three years from allotment as per condition no 6 of allotment letter but despite full payment possession has still not been offered. The Complainant has attached the scheme of the project and allotment letter. It is pertinent to mention here that a complaint Misc. ref. No. 1 of 2019 titled as \"RERA vs The Estate Officer, PDA\" was filed for notice u/s 59 of the Act. In the absence of sufficient and cogent evidence in support of the notice,  Shri J.S. Khushdil, former Member of the Authority had disposed of/filed the matter on 30.10.2019 with some directions. Now, we may seek the latest status of the registration of the project from the Registration Branch. In terms of Officer Order dated 05.01.2023, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please. ',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:45:12.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:45:12.000'),(377,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:57:49.000',1556,'MCNo00062022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-10-23 11:57:52.590','','2023-10-23 11:57:52.590','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely \'PDA Omax City Patiala\' located at Sirhind road village Baran Patiala. The Complainant has submitted that he is a plot holder in PDA Omaxe City Patiala since 2009. The Project is ongoing one as they have not obtained completion certificate on the date of coming into force of RERA Act, 2016. The promoter have not registered their project with RERA till today. By not doing so the developer made themselves liable for action as per section 59 of the RERA Act, 2016. It is pertinent to mention here that a complaint Misc. ref. No. 1 of 2019 titled as \"RERA vs The Estate Officer, PDA\" was filed for notice u/s 59 of the Act. In the absence of sufficient and cogent evidence in support of the notice,  Shri J.S. Khushdil, former Member of the Authority had disposed of/filed the matter on 30.10.2019 with some directions. Now, we may seek the latest status of the registration of the project from the Registration Branch. In terms of Officer Order dated 05.01.2023, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:57:49.000','legaladvrera','2023-10-23 11:57:49.000'),(378,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:22:25.000',1565,'MCNo00152022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 15:22:26.556','','2023-12-06 15:22:26.556','','The complaint was forwarded to the the bench of Shri Ajay Pal Singh, Ld. Member of the Authority. A notice u/s 59 of the Act was issued to the promoter of the project. Vide Order dated 08.09.2023, a penalty of Rs. 50,00,000/- (Rupees Fifty Lacs) was imposed upon the respondent/promoter. The penalty is to be deposited by the promoter within 2 months from the date of receipt of order. If the amount is not deposited within specified time, recovery certificate will be issued to the Collector, SAS Nagar (Mohali) for effecting the recovery.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:22:25.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:22:25.000'),(379,550054,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:31:40.000',1594,'MCNo00092023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 15:31:41.712','','2023-12-06 15:31:41.712','','As directed by Ld. Member (APS) on 02.11.2023, the complainant was asked to file the complaint in Form M/N through email dated 07.11.2023. Further, as per directions, the complaint was also forwarded to the project registration branch to link the project registration file for consideration by the Authority.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:31:40.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-06 15:31:40.000'),(380,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:09:36.000',1593,'MCNo00082023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 16:09:37.665','','2023-12-06 16:09:37.665','','The complaint was forwarded to Project and Registration Branch on 19.06.2023 for comments. Thereafter, the same was put up to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson with the comments of Registration Branch on 06.07.2023. As ordered by the Ld. Bench, a notice under section 59 of the Act was issued vide this office Memo No. RERA/2023/PS/CP/8442 dated 20.07.2022.',2,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:09:36.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:09:36.000'),(381,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:15.000',1593,'MCNo00082023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 16:10:16.368','','2023-12-06 16:10:16.368','','The complaint was forwarded to Project and Registration Branch on 19.06.2023 for comments. Thereafter, the same was put up to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson with the comments of Registration Branch on 06.07.2023. As ordered by the Ld. Bench, a notice under section 59 of the Act was issued vide this office Memo No. RERA/2023/PS/CP/8442 dated 20.07.2022.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:15.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:15.000'),(382,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:48.000',1592,'MCNo00072023','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 16:10:49.509','','2023-12-06 16:10:49.509','','The complaint was forwarded to Project and Registration Branch on 19.06.2023 for comments. Thereafter, the same was put up to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson with the comments of Registration Branch on 06.07.2023. As ordered by the Ld. Bench, a notice under section 59 of the Act was issued vide this office Memo No. RERA/2023/PS/CP/8442 dated 20.07.2022.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:48.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:10:48.000'),(383,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-12-06 16:14:46.000',1585,'MCNo00352022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-06 16:14:47.634','','2023-12-06 16:14:47.634','','The complaint 