1-2014 was issued to complainant. Even allotment letter has not been issued after passing of 8 years and payment of 25%. So, the complainant has requested to take action against PUDA, Bathinda. The Complainant has attached the copy of scheme with layout and LOI and memo. The Registration Branch on 21.03.2023 has reported that the project PUDA Enclave Sugar Mill Site, Faridkot is not registered with this Authority nor is in the process of registration. However, one project with name PUDA Enclave, Sugar Mill Site at Budhlada is registered with this Authority. In terms of Office Order dated 05.01.2023, the jurisdiction of the project falls under the bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority. Accordingly, the same is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 09:52:12.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-07 09:52:12.000'),(389,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 13:37:28.000',1522,'MCNo00222021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-07 13:37:29.540','','2023-12-07 13:37:29.540','','Present Misc. complaint was received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been filed against the Project namely \'RS Enclave\' located at National Highway, Opposite Dera Baba Darshan Singh, Kala Ghanupur, Chhehartta, Amritsar Punjab. The Complainant has submitted that the project \'RS Enclave\' is unauthorized colony developing since July 2021. The Complainant has requested to issue directions to Local Bodies Department for taking action as per PAPRA Act 1995 and Punjab Municipal Corporation Act 1976. Present complaint was put up to the bench of Ld. Member (APS) for consideration on 16.11.2022 alongwith the comments of Registration Branch on file. The proceedings are still under process.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 13:37:28.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-07 13:37:28.000'),(390,550048,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 14:10:22.000',1555,'M