:20:53.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-07 14:20:53.000'),(392,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:03:22.000',1517,'MCNo00172021','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-07 16:03:24.353','','2023-12-07 16:03:24.353','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Tdi City located at Sector 117, Airport Road, SAS Nagar, Punjab. The Complainant has submitted that TDI Infratech Ltd. is developing a Mega Housing Project which includes various Sectors like Sector 74A, 92, 116, 117, 118, 119. The complainant Society has further submitted that the Residential Plots part at Sector 117 which includes almost 100 Acres is not registered with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority. Builder has taken the Partial Completion Certificate from the GMADA in the year 2017 but failed to provide the basic facilities in this area. The Complainant has requested to take a strict action of non-registration of project. The complainant has enclosed the Inspection report of committee made by GMADA and Partial Completion Certificate. In terms of Officer Order dated 05.01.2023, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:03:22.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:03:22.000'),(393,550053,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:36:52.000',1552,'MCNo00022022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Chairperson RERA','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-07 16:36:54.368','','2023-12-07 16:36:54.368','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Tdi Mega residential project sector 74A, 92,116,117,118 and 119 TDI City SAS Nagar, Mohali. The Complainant has submitted that M/s TDI INDFRATECH LTD has not registered TDI MEGA HOUSING PROJECT SECTOR 74A, 116, 117, 118 & 119 TDI CITY MOHALI, area 177.746 acre under Punjab RERA. He has further submitted that promoter has not applied for the RERA Registration for the above mentioned 177.746 acre. In terms of Officer Order dated 05.01.2023, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Chairperson of the Authority for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:36:52.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-07 16:36:52.000'),(394,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:19:40.000',1575,'MCNo00252022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-08 17:19:42.337','','2023-12-08 17:19:42.337','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Green wood Residency Part-1 in Sunny Enclave Sector 125, Rakba Fethullapur, DesumajraTehsil Kharar, Mohali. The same was forwarded to Registration Branch on 06.03.2023 and after seeking comments put up to the Bench of Ld. Member (APS) on 20.04.2023.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:19:40.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:19:40.000'),(395,550049,'legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:20:29.000',1576,'MCNo00262022','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member APS','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2023-12-08 17:20:31.368','','2023-12-08 17:20:31.368','','Present Misc. complaint has been received online under the link of \'unregistered projects complaints\'. The complaint has been received against the Project namely Green wood Residency Part-1 in Sunny Enclave Sector 125, Rakba Fethullapur, DesumajraTehsil Kharar, Mohali. The same was forwarded to Registration Branch on 06.03.2023 and after seeking comments put up to the Bench of Ld. Member (APS) on 20.04.2023.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:20:29.000','legaladvrera','2023-12-08 17:20:29.000'),