the project is not registered with the RERA authorities (vii) the payments from customers are taken by builder in account of Singh Builders and Developers whereas the registrations are done by individual persons. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, which relates to the bench of vacation bench of the Authority. In terms of Order dated 10.01.24, the powers for dealing with references/cases under Section 59 and proceedings under Chapter VIII of the Act, have been delegated to Ld. Member RKG, accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench of Ld. Member RKG for kind consideration and further orders please.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2024-01-15 14:57:34.000','legaladvrera','2024-01-15 14:57:34.000'),(399,550054,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:13:45.000',1586,'MCNo00012023','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-22 15:13:49.372','','2024-01-22 15:13:49.372','','Vide email dated 22.01.2024, the complaint has been informed to institute the complaint online at the official website of this Authority under Section 31 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in Form M or Form N.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:13:45.000','legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:13:45.000'),(400,550054,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:19:39.000',1572,'MCNo00222022','','','Authority Desk','Notice sent as Final Order and Judgement Issued','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-22 15:19:43.638','','2024-01-22 15:19:43.638','','Vide email dated 22.01.2024, the complaint has been advised to institute the complaint online at the official website of this Authority under Section 31 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in Form M or Form N or file claims before the Hon\'ble NCLT since the proceedings against the Gupta Builders and Promoters are already pending before the NCLT.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:19:39.000','legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:19:39.000'),