on 31 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in Form M or Form N. But no communication address, email or phone number is provided by the Complainant, so could not be informed. Moreover, the project is registered with the Authority.',1,0,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:25:55.000','legaladvrera','2024-01-22 15:25:55.000'),(405,550048,'legaladvrera','2024-01-22 16:05:47.000',1602,'MCNo00022024','','','Authority Desk','Complaint Forwarded to Member RKG','7330c9a0-4296-4ddf-a421-0d0c491adf2d','','2024-01-22 16:05:51.528','','2024-01-22 16:05:51.528','','The complaint has been received against the Project namely Metro park /A-Tech Infrastructure Pvt Ltd, located at industrial zone Sector 103 Mohali, Punjab. The Complainant namely Naresh Kumar R/o 328 Sector 5 B New Shasti Nagar Mandi Gobindgarh, has submitted that the developer project has lapsed as per the list available on the website of Rera Punjab, as on 30th of September 2023 and the developer had sought extension of the same under Section 7 the Act, which would imply that do the registration of RERA was given to the developer, but as of now the status of the project is in abeyance till further extension is granted to the developer for the purpose of advertisement, marketing, book, sale, or offer of sale, or invite persons to purchase in any manner, any plot, apartment, or building in any real estate project, or part of it in any planning, development or municipal area without registering the real estate project. The Complainant has further submitted that the developer is regularly advertising the project on its own website in question and advertising it on all social platforms. The project falls under the jurisdiction of Tehsil Kharar, which relates to the bench of vacation bench of the Authority. In terms of Order dated 10.01.2024, the powers for dealing with references/cases under Section 59, 61 and 63, have been delegated to Ld. Member (RKG), accordingly, the complaint is forwarded to the Bench o